msgid "Places on the phone itself"
msgstr "Plekken op de telefoon zelf"

#: plinius-boot:8142
msgid ""
"An experiment. This takes room from Volla OS and erases all its data. The "
"boot menu stays on the memory card, so it is needed for these systems too."
