msgstr "Plekken op de telefoon maken?"

#: plinius-boot:8187
msgid ""
"An experiment: it is not known yet whether Volla OS and its updates get "
"along with this. All data of Volla OS is erased. The app saves the partition "
"table first and can put it back from here, but the data stays gone. Back up "
"what you need first."
msgstr ""
